  "name": "@muneemji/mcp-client",
  "readme": "# @muneemji/mcp-client\n\nTypeScript MCP **stdio bridge** built with the official [`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@modelcontextprotocol/sdk).\n\nCursor / Claude Desktop spawn this package via `npx`. It exposes tools on **stdio** and proxies them to your remote **Muneemji** MCP server over **Streamable HTTP**, authenticated with an API key.\n\n```\nMCP host (Cursor / Claude Desktop)\n        \u2502  stdio  (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk Server)\n        \u25bc\n@muneemji/mcp-client  (this package)\n        \u2502  Streamable HTTP  (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk Client)\n        \u25bc\nMuneemji /api/mcp  (TypeScript MCP server in muneemji-core)\n```\n\n## Environment variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `MUNEEMJI_MCP_URL` | yes | e.g. `https://your-domain.com/api/mcp` |\n| `MUNEEMJI_API_KEY` | yes | From **Settings \u2192 Account \u2192 API keys** |\n| `MUNEEMJI_TIMEOUT_MS` | no | HTTP timeout (default `30000`) |\n\nNo secrets are bundled in this package.\n\n## Cursor configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"muneemji\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@muneemji/mcp-client\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"MUNEEMJI_MCP_URL\": \"https://your-domain.com/api/mcp\",\n        \"MUNEEMJI_API_KEY\": \"mcp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Claude Desktop configuration\n\nSame shape in `claude_desktop_config.json` under `mcpServers`.\n\n## Development\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run build\nMUNEEMJI_MCP_URL=http://localhost:10000/api/mcp \\\nMUNEEMJI_API_KEY=mcp_xxx \\\nnpm start\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js `>=18`\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
  "readmeFilename": "README.md",
